  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **First Light** (1 review): Reviewer highlighted First Light and Steam Engine as standout moments of the performance [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Good Intentions**: rare: 6 archived performances [9]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2011-06-10.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 120 min; rated 5/5 by 7 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Listener recalled hearing the initial horn sounds of Victory Dance while crossing the field [8]\n- Jim James and crew performed alongside the Preservation Hall Jazz Band [1]\n- The festival lineup included Arcade Fire, The Decemberists, and Florence + The Machine [10]\n- Band altered their playing style, adding extra jams to the ends of songs [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2011-06-10.flac**: taped by willsfc; transferred by MSTaper; source: Avantone CK-1 (cardoid) > Fostex FR-2LE (24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded using Avantone CK-1 mics into a Fostex FR-2LE recorder [1]",
